// NDF-BEGIN: PTO-BSTART-STD-CONTROL-001
// ndf: kind=contract level=L1 layer=block status=accepted
// BSTART.STD MUST accept only FALL(0), DIRECT, COND, IND, and RET, MUST
// initialize one STD BARG after successful predecessor retirement, and MUST
// reject nonzero Fixup payloads and deleted bare call forms before effects.
// NDF-END: PTO-BSTART-STD-CONTROL-001
